#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0705 expect=violation domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: Within a given value of PARAMCD for a combination of device and subject, PBCHG is populated and is not equal to ((BASE-AVAL)/AVAL)*100
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=1 USUBJID=01-701-1015
# Declared-tier scope: structure= states the ADaM data structure this minimal table stands for;
# #define is its mandatory carrier (ScenarioDeclaredScopeProvider.install).
#define standard=adamig version=1-3
dataset ADLBC structure="MEDICAL DEVICE BASIC DATA STRUCTURE"
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL type=Num
col BASE type=Num
col PBCHG type=Num
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | GLUC | 4 | 10 | 999
---
